WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.759 --> 00:00:10.969
Yes it certainly was a bit smaller as it was six councillors and myself as acting mayor.

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:15.830
and of course David, the Deputy Mayor and two other councillors over at

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:21.660
Passchendaele. They're over there with
approximately forty RSA members from

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:26.039
around the district, so the
representation from this district in

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.660
Passchendaele is very big.

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:32.880
On the 12th of this month there will be at the Kaiapoi Cenotaph

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.840
there will be a
commemoration service of which, just

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:41.219
about all the remainder of councillors
will be there. Wendy Doody is

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:44.460
going to deliver a speech on behalf of
the council there.

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:50.719
Great to see giant steps starting to
happen for Kaiapoi on that

00:00:50.719 --> 00:00:57.090
regeneration area. We passed yesterday
the wall in the river on the north side

00:00:57.090 --> 00:01:00.390
of the river to be strengthened.  Ready
for the development on the site that

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:05.280
which used to be the Hansons Mall.  That
will take place hopefully in November,

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:07.900
the first sod will be turned on that.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:11.280
In regards to the approval of the

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:15.340
stopping of the roads, that was also
passed yesterday at Council.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:19.780
I think that's a huge psychological step, not only for Kaiapoi, but for the whole

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:23.650
district. Once those roads start to
disappear and it returns back to green

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:30.280
and all the the new plan starts to come
together this is really going to set

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:35.000
Kaiapoi back on the path of of really
being healed

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:43.860
We did approve $30,000 for next year
for the food forest.

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:50.820
Hugely successful project with the planting of trees and
250 people turning up a couple of weeks

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:55.160
ago to get that well underway, so now
there is some some funding in which

00:01:55.160 --> 00:02:00.000
people can draw on and the lease is now
signed for that land.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.520
But that's fantastic news for some very
hard-working trustees,

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:04.840
who have put that together.

